snippet.description:
So this girl went viral in a YouTube street interview after being asked whether she’d save her husband or her guy best friend—and she chose her guy best friend. After the clip blew up, her boyfriend broke up with her, and her best friend cut her off too. Now she actually started a petition to remove street interview videos.

Person in the Video:
@loulouorange

